 ['P0','Draft to issued invoice','Create a draft, add buyer/items, save, reopen and issue using an approved test series.','Draft persists. Issuance creates one immutable numbered document and one applicable fee debit.'],
 ['P0','Required invoice fields','Omit required seller/buyer/date/item/registration fields one at a time for each supported document type.','Clear field validation blocks invalid issuance without advancing the number or debiting wallet.'],
 ['P0','Registered series and branch scope','Issue using active, missing, expired, exhausted and wrong-branch series.','Only the correct active series issues within its approved range and preserves formatting.'],
 ['P0','Concurrent numbering','Issue multiple documents concurrently in one branch and in separate branches.','Unique, ordered series allocation within each scope. No duplicate number or cross-branch collision.','Isolated lab'],
 ['P0','Rollback does not consume number','Force failure after number reservation but before transaction commit. Retry the valid issue.','No partial financial record or charge. Transactional reservation rolls back consistently.','Isolated lab'],
 ['P0','Void number is never reused','Void an issued test invoice and attempt to reuse its number.','Original number/history remain preserved. Reuse is rejected.'],
 ['P0','External ERP invoice numbers','Capture valid source invoice identifiers with leading zeros/prefixes; try invalid format and duplicate identity.','Source number is printed unchanged when valid. NUERS reference remains separate; conflicts are not overwritten.'],
 ['P0','Same invoice number across merchants','Create the same visible number under A and B. Open each from merchant, admin and PDF routes.','Lookup resolves the exact authorized merchant/document identity every time.'],
 ['P0','Issued document edits and cancellation','Try editing totals/identity after issuance. Use the supported cancel/correction workflow with evidence.','Issued financial history is preserved. Changes require the appropriate linked record and audit trail.'],
 ['P1','Sales invoice versus payment copy','Issue an invoice and record its payment or supplementary document. Compare sales totals and fee ledger.','Payment copy is linked and not counted as a second sale or charged again.'],
 ['P1','Buyer and customer selection','Select an existing customer, add a new one and switch customers before issue.','Correct buyer data is saved. Failed/draft operations do not create unintended duplicate customers.'],
 ['P1','Print registration and POS fields','Preview applicable CAS and POS documents with supplied registration/branch/MIN/MSN evidence.','Applicable recorded registration fields appear correctly. Missing evidence is not fabricated.']
